    "identifier": "fire-release-sunburst",
    "description": "<p>Brilliant sunlight flashes in a 60-foot radius centered on point you can see within range. Each creature in that light must make a constitution saving throw, taking 8d6+8 Fire damage and is Blinded for 1 minute on a failed save. On a successful save, it takes half as much damage and isn’t Blinded by this jutsu.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above A-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and increase the damage by 1d6+1.</p>",
